      ],
      "description": "<p>Jose finds out why BioWare is bringing multiplayer to Dragon Age: Inquisition; we talk with the producers behind Horns and Dumb and Dumber To; Victor catches up with The Sixth Sense director M. Night Shyamalan for a look at his new TV show Wayward Pines; Ben and Jose bring us a review of Call of ",
